# Log phien live 2026-10-04, copy nguyen van tu output da nhan trong phien

## 1. Banner cua ttyd, loc ra lenh chay tren box

```text
/bin/sh -c exec env LD_PRELOAD=/opt/wish/shim.so /opt/wish/client /tmp/sat.sock (b92d58887f29)
connected. type HELP for commands.
```

## 2. Rang buoc giao dien: khong co shell, chi 7 lenh

```text
> HELP
commands:
  STATUS                 plot bodies in the X-Z plane
  AUTHENTICATE         authenticate this session
  THRUST <name> <x> <z>  set standing thrust direction
  STOP <name>            cancel thrust for a body
  INFO <name>            show position/velocity/radius/mass
  HELP                   show this message
  QUIT                   exit
> echo MARKER1; whoami; id; pwd; uname -a
unknown command: ECHO (type HELP)
```

