## 4. Auth bypass (the gioi nguyen ven, phien dau tien)

```text
> AUTHENTICATE
Enter password (hex-encoded): 414141414141414141414141414141414141414141414141c93a400000000000
auth forced via dbgauthenticated
> THRUST Satellite -1 0
OK
```

## 5. Dot nhien lieu, do duoc phuong trinh rocket

```text
> INFO Satellite
position: (-286.6762932133575, 0, 0)
velocity: (-28.293854944373365, 0, 0)
mass:     0.74999999999999978
> INFO Satellite
position: (-1459.3034660473015, 0, 0)
velocity: (-68.220297140345764, 0, 0)
mass:     0.49999999999999994
```

`28.293854944373365 / ln(1/0.75) = 98.32`, `68.220297140345764 / ln(1/0.5) = 98.44`
=> `v = ve * ln(m0/m)`, `ve ~ 98.4`, nhien lieu tu 1.0 xuong san 0.5, tong delta-v = 68.22.

## 6. Nhịp sim: 2.5 s thuc = 25 s sim (10 tick/s)

```text
position: (-3164.8108945559461, 0, 0)   # cach goi tru do 2.5 s
position: (-4870.3183230645909, 0, 0)
```

`4870.3183230645909 - 3164.8108945559461 = 1705.507` units; `1705.507 / 68.220297 = 25.0` s sim.

## 7. The gioi da bi brick: Earth bi nut, sat tinh het nhien lieu

```text
> THRUST Earth 1e300 0
ERR no such body Earth
> INFO Earth
ERR no such body Earth
> THRUST Satellite -0.01 0
OK
> INFO Satellite
position: (-39048.68719037783, 0, 0)
velocity: (-68.220297140345764, 0, 0)
mass:     0.49999999999999994
```

`velocity` khong doi khi thrust luc `mass = 0.5` => khong con nhien lieu. `ECHO` tra
`unknown command: ECHO (type HELP)`, bang lenh cua `dispatch` chi co 7 dong, khong co lenh reset the gioi.

